# Lead Discovery Pipeline

An automated lead discovery pipeline built using Python, Playwright, Supabase and n8n.

This project was built to automate my outbound prospecting workflow. Instead of manually browsing the Meta Ads Library, opening every advertiser, checking their Instagram profile and qualifying them one by one, this pipeline performs the entire process automatically.

The architecture is intentionally modular so it can be adapted to virtually any niche by simply changing the search term.

---

# Features

- Scrapes businesses directly from the Meta Ads Library
- Detects Instagram call-to-action links from advertisements
- Enriches Instagram business profiles using GraphQL interception
- Extracts:
  - Followers
  - Following
  - Number of posts
  - Biography
  - Website
  - Last posting date
- Stores structured data inside Supabase (PostgreSQL)
- Prevents duplicate profile enrichment
- Sends Telegram notifications for qualified leads through n8n
- Designed to be reusable for any industry

---

# Why I Built This

Finding businesses actively spending money on advertising is one of the strongest buying signals for outbound prospecting.

My manual workflow looked like this:

Meta Ads Library
→ Open advertiser
→ Open Instagram
→ Check followers
→ Copy information
→ Repeat hundreds of times

I wanted to automate that process.

This project continuously builds a structured database of businesses currently running Meta advertisements and enriches their public Instagram data for further qualification.

---

# Architecture

                Meta Ads Library
                       │
                       ▼
            Playwright Meta Scraper
                       │
                       ▼
                 Supabase Database
                       │
                       ▼
          Playwright Instagram Enricher
                       │
                       ▼
              Updated Business Database
                       │
                       ▼
                 n8n Automation
                       │
                       ▼
              Telegram Notifications
---

