# Database

The pipeline stores businesses inside a PostgreSQL database.

Example fields:

- archive_id
- page_name
- title
- body
- cta
- instagram_link
- followers
- following
- posts
- bio
- website
- last_post
- status
- telegram_notified

---

# Customization

To search another industry, simply replace the search term inside the Meta Ads scraper.

Example searches:

- Dentist
- Roofing
- Law Firm
- Restaurant
- Gym
- Real Estate
- Accounting
- Financial Advisor

The Instagram enrichment stage requires no changes as long as the advertisement points to an Instagram profile.

---

# Possible Extensions

- Website enrichment
- Email enrichment
- AI lead scoring
- CRM integration
- RAG knowledge base
- Company intelligence
- Multi-platform enrichment

---

# Notes

This project was built as a practical automation engineering project.

No Instagram scraping is performed through private APIs or authentication bypasses. The pipeline only processes publicly accessible business profile information exposed through Instagram's web client while browsing normally with Playwright.

