# Important 

I only recommend 200 scrolls, as I have given it in the scraper's code itself; run it multiple times a day with intervals so you stay under Meta's radar. As for the Instagram scraper, be extra aware, save a session and use it as context to open the page every single time till it expires; make sure you stay under 200 profiles in a single run. Even though I have randomised the numbers, it's still good to be cautious.  